<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank raises reverse repo rate.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank raises reverse repo rate.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Argentine Central Bank said Wednesday it was raising the reverse repurchase tender agreement rate to 5.0 percent from 4.75 percent.</p>
<p>The last change in the reverse repo rate was on July 1, 1996 when the Central Bank reduced it to 4.75 percent from 4.90 percent.</p>
<p>The repurchase tender agreement rate remains unchanged at 9.0 percent.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0633))</p>
